        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/edgy/mission_fox/scene_fox_contractcreation.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository bcb10fff-1861-4864-ad0a-4b1dff045c24).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47,\r\rI have discovered evidence that Michail &quot;Mishoo&quot; Nenkov smuggled a large sum of a special drug to Berlin and is handing it out to the public. The drug was made by an old target &apos;Rico Delgado&apos; and after his death, his workers kept developing the drug. These four people are the only people to have currently taken it and I would like you to eliminate them before the drug is handed to other people.\r\rI will leave you to prepare...",
